On a spinner with $n$ equal sectors, an outcome with $k$ sectors has probability $\dfrac{k}{n}$.

[tikz]
\begin{tikzpicture}[every node/.style={font=\large}]
\foreach \k in {0,1,2} {\filldraw[gray!35, draw=black] (0,0) -- ({\k*360/7}:1.5) arc ({\k*360/7}:{(\k+1)*360/7}:1.5) -- cycle;}
\draw[thick] (0,0) circle (1.5);
\foreach \k in {0,...,6} {\draw (0,0) -- ({\k*360/7}:1.5);}
\node[font=\small] at (0,-2.1) {$n$ equal sectors, $k$ of them shaded};
\end{tikzpicture}
[/tikz]
